patio. Application is straightforward with a low-pressure pump sprayer, working from the bottom of the wall upward to prevent streaking, at a coverage rate of roughly 100-150 square feet per gallon on porous CMU block and up to 200 square feet on dense poured concrete. At $50-65 per gallon, it is a reasonable investment for the square footage typically involved in a retaining wall project.",
