      "Available in multiple tint colors for retaining walls and landscape features where appearance matters",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Film-forming chemistry can peel or blister if hydrostatic pressure pushes moisture from behind the wall",
      "Not rated for constant hydrostatic pressure — manufacturer explicitly recommends it for above-grade use only",
